name xstest
# XSTest: test prompts for exaggerated safety behaviours in language models, and three models' completions of them
# with their annotations. The readme's title: "XSTest: A Test Suite for Identifying Exaggerated Safety Behaviours in
# Large Language Models".
witness XSTest
# The deviation is this recipe's choice for a curated academic resource; the specification does not give one.
deviation 90
root $LAPLACE_DATA/.refresh-*/Safety/XSTest/extracted/xstest-*
except */evaluation/* *.gitignore
after unicode iso-639
reads text
